# Copy to .env.local (git-ignored) and fill in. Never commit a real value.

# The shared passcode for /investors and /investors/diligence.
#
# Read out on a call. It is compared on the SERVER — see lib/investor-access.ts
# — and the browser never receives it, nor the material it guards.
#
# UNSET MEANS LOCKED, NOT OPEN. If this variable is missing the gate accepts
# nothing and the pages render only the form plus "Request access". A missing
# environment variable can therefore cause a lockout; it can never cause a leak.
#
# Rotating this value invalidates every cookie already issued, because the
# cookie holds a keyed digest of the passcode rather than a flag. Rotation
# really does revoke.
INVESTOR_PASSCODE=
